TEXT 96 912 Left 2 ;Voltage regulator (current-mode bandgap + LDO) on Vunregulated: NPN PTAT core Qb (A=1) / Qa (A=8) with R3, CTAT resistors R2/R4 (Banba-type), equal-current PMOS mirrors M10-M13 driven by error amp Ma/Mb/Mn1/Mn2 + Mc/M9; start-up M1-M5; bias outputs VBN/VCN; VX = ICONST*R5 drives LDO amp M23/M25 -> pass device M29 -> VREF = VX(1+R7/R6).
